       This command lets you explicitly access the on-line help system. Using
       this command, you can get help for any of the commands available on
       the main menu.

@X0F
   Subcommands

       @X0B[command]       @X03The command or filename that you want additional
                       assistance with.

@X0F
   Description
@X03
       Each of PCBoard's main commands have additional assistance available
       in the form of on-line help.  The on-line help will be displayed on
       the screen.  To access help for a particular command, enter the
       command you want additional help with when prompted.

@X0F
   Examples
@X03
       To get online help for the R user command, you would type in the
       following:
@X07
           H R
@X03
       If the SysOp has defined additional help topics, you can access these
       by entering the topic you want help with.  For example, if a topic is
       listed as ORDER, you would type the following to get help for that
       particular topic:
@X07
           H ORDER
